Subject: Add canonical binary scrolls (feature: binary) and the xz seal (feature: xz)

Public items: 16 added, 0 removed, 0 changed. Dependencies: base64 added at 0.22; xz2 added at 0.1. Code lines after this commit: 3101.

commit 4f82dd5cf0a2ef24b59267c97bbc4954210682cd
parent 65913a3ae05496d068aed1d979e35fce28531932
author Theia <theia@mirrorborn.us>
